@startuml
hide footbox
title Tạo phiếu nhập hàng từ nhà cung cấp
actor Employee
participant AdminPortal
participant API
participant ImportService
participant PostgreSQL

Employee->AdminPortal: Nhập nhà cung cấp và các dòng hàng
AdminPortal->API: POST /imports
API->ImportService: Validate supplier and detail rows
ImportService->PostgreSQL: BEGIN transaction
ImportService->PostgreSQL: Lock and load supplier and variants
PostgreSQL-->ImportService: Valid references
ImportService->ImportService: Calculate subtotals and total
ImportService->PostgreSQL: INSERT stock_import
ImportService->PostgreSQL: INSERT import_detail rows
ImportService->PostgreSQL: COMMIT transaction
PostgreSQL-->ImportService: Import saved
ImportService-->API: Import document
API-->AdminPortal: 201 created
AdminPortal-->Employee: Hiển thị phiếu nhập

@enduml
